@@ -0,0 +1,31 @@
+/**
+ * Distribution: install idempotency skeleton (spec section 5, gate G5).
+ *
+ * One clean install, then two repeat installs of the same manifest must produce
+ * no profile diff and no second release directory. The installer only orchestrates
+ * official profile/plugin commands and pnpm; it never parses plugin dependencies.
+ *
